/*
!/.claude/
!/agent/

# Dabbler/dabbler-docs is deliberately NOT tracked here (CEO ruling 2026-09-05,
# commit b6c3747). It is NOT unversioned: it is an independent Git repository,
# canonical remote dabblersport/dabbler-docs, branch master. Its history up to
# 67cf424 also remains in this repo's past commits, at the old dabbler-docs/ path.
# The exact governance commit this Thebes architecture was verified against is
# pinned in CLAUDE.md under "Governance Repository". Do not re-track it here —
# a second copy of CONTRACT.md is a second authority.
!/CLAUDE.md
!/.gitignore
!/*.md

# Re-exclusion: !/.claude/ above re-includes the whole directory, which would
# otherwise pull in machine-local settings. Last matching rule wins.
/.claude/settings.local.json

# Auto-written session state, not knowledge. Contains live test credentials.
# Same category as .claude-flow/, which /* already excludes.
/.claude/agent-memory/

# macOS finder droppings at any depth (the /* rule only shields the root copy).
.DS_Store

# Flow event log — written by agent/scripts/flow-hook.sh on every tool call.
# Local telemetry, not knowledge: it holds commands and file paths from every
# session and would grow without bound in git.
/agent/.flow/

# Wave 4 Persistent State — runtime records. Mutable orchestration state written
# during execution: tasks, routing requests, exceptions, dependency edges, locks.
# Durable on disk and across sessions, deliberately outside source history —
# tracking them would keep the working tree dirty during normal Product execution
# and make Git responsible for a live orchestration database. The state doctrine,
# tooling and Company/Product/Project registry above it ARE tracked.
/agent/state/runtime/
